        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Rattled by the Rush\", \"Wowee Zowee\"\n- People: Pavement\n- Places: Stockton, California\n- Topics: indie rock\n\nFacts:\n- Pavement was an American indie rock band that formed in Stockton, California in 1989.\n- \"Rattled by the Rush\" was a single/EP released by Pavement in 1995.\n- \"Rattled by the Rush\" was the single for the song \"Rattled by the Rush,\" which was the first single from Pavement's third album \"Wowee Zowee\" in 1995.\n- Pavement undertook a well-received reunion tour in 2010.",
